   "like_count": 4,
   "cooked": "<p>Hi everyone <img alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"/>!</p>\n<h2>We have been working on an improved demo of the hatch front-end and smart contracts these last days.</h2>\n<h1>\n<img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <a href=\"https://hatch-demo.netlify.app/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Play with the Demo NOW!</a> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/>\n</h1>\n<hr/>\n<p>Here are the main highlights:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implementation of the new hatch goal indicators and front-end polishing (theme and style fixes, and responsive view implementation) (made by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paulo\">@paulo</a>).</li>\n<li>Hatch aragon connector and Aragon Connect reliability improvements fixing some bugs that appeared when sending transactions (made by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paulo\">@paulo</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gabi\">@gabi</a>).</li>\n<li>New feedback button with a screenshot feature (made by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paulo\">@paulo</a>)</li>\n<li>Add support to EIP-3085, allowing the addition of the xDAI network to the wallet with just one click (made by <span class=\"mention\">@sunguru98</span> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/paulo\">@paulo</a>)</li>\n<li>Smart contract changes to avoid creating votes during the hatch period or the closing/refund period (made by <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sem\">@sem</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<hr/>\n<h1>\n<img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <a href=\"https://hatch-demo.netlify.app/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Play with the Demo NOW!</a> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/>\n</h1>\n<hr/>\n<p>It uses the following contracts:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatch Template: <a href=\"https://blockscout.com/xdai/mainnet/address/0xf5D837fCa07E14AC665025C05f6D7f79E0d0112A\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">0xf5D837fCa07E14AC665025C05f6D7f79E0d0112A</a>\n</li>\n<li>Hatch DAO: <a href=\"https://aragon.1hive.org/#/0xB576b7A36216EE04DC1A24610e24B3c4fd545E5a\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">0xB576b7A36216EE04DC1A24610e24B3c4fd545E5a</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Also, below you can find the main timeline which is starting today (thanks to <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/sem\">@sem</a> for creating it <img alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"/>):</p>\n<h2><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" data-download-href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/ed7ede794f309f5a9ac798b701d102420e0520de\" href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/ed7ede794f309f5a9ac798b701d102420e0520de.png\" title=\"Screenshot from 2021-05-04 00-08-12\"><img alt=\"Screenshot from 2021-05-04 00-08-12\" data-base62-sha1=\"xSYYwlKS7iRvpoGmDv4utNgtN7M\" data-small-upload=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/optimized/1X/ed7ede794f309f5a9ac798b701d102420e0520de_2_10x10.png\" height=\"302\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/ed7ede794f309f5a9ac798b701d102420e0520de.png\" width=\"690\"/><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2021-05-04 00-08-12</span><span class=\"informations\">733×321 17.4 KB</span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></h2>\n<h1>\n<img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <a href=\"https://hatch-demo.netlify.app/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Play with the Demo NOW!</a> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/> <img alt=\":zap:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/zap.png?v=9\" title=\":zap:\"/>\n</h1>\n<hr/>\n<p>By the way, if you find any bug or problem when playing with the demo, feel free to use the feedback button on the lower left corner to tell us about it.</p>\n<p><em>Edited by Griff to highlight the demo</em></p>",
