   "reply_to_post_number": null,
   "like_count": 1,
   "cooked": "<p>Thanks <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ZeptimusQ\">@ZeptimusQ</a> .</p>\n<p>Regarding the +20$ fee, this is a Metamask UI bug that happens because Metamask is using the ETH price to calculate and display the USD fee, but in reality it is using XDAI underneath so you’re really not paying that amount of money to send your tx.</p>",
